  "next_id": 58,
  "notes": [
    {
      "at": [
        -40,
        -34
      ],
      "id": 52,
      "text": "ATmega8A at 8 MHz (internal RC, low fuse E4) running avr_bus: TWI at 100 kHz to an LM75 (0x48) and a 24C02\n(0x50, a byte written at 0x10 and read back), with 4.7 kOhm pull-ups; SPI at 2 MHz to a 74HC595 whose outputs\ncount every 100 ms (STCP on PB2). Every 0.5 s the terminal shows the temperature, the byte and the count.\nWhile running, drag the LM75 or turn the wheel over it to change its temperature."
    }
  ],
